格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Prompt Rail 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 会话页的紧凑纵向提示词快速跳转条。每一条横杠对应一条当前已加载的普通用户提示词。悬停或键盘聚焦会展示预览；点击会滚动跳转到对应提示词。","id":"gh:1334924900","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-prompt-rail","slug":"Zzzzkd/dsh-prompt-rail","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Prompt Rail 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 会话页的紧凑纵向提示词快速跳转条。每一条横杠对应一条当前已加载的普通用户提示词。悬停或键盘聚焦会展示预览；点击会滚动跳转到对应提示"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ompt Rail 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 会话页的紧凑纵向提示词快速跳转条。每一条横杠对应一条当前已加载的普通用户提示词。悬停或键盘聚焦会展示预览；点击会滚动跳转到对应提示词。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Prompt Rail"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Prompt Rail** is a compact vertical quick-jump rail for the DeepSeek Harness Web conversation view"},{"id":"p4s2","text":". One mark represents one **loaded ordinary user prompt**. Hover or keyboard focus shows its preview"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"; clicking scrolls to that prompt."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Behavior"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- The rail stays vertically centered beside the session sidebar.\n- Every mark has a 10px high hit sl"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ot, while its default visible mark is an 8px by 3px light line.\n- Hover/focus makes the current mark"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" 28px wide and dark; nearby marks taper to 20px, 14px, and 10px.\n- Clicking records the selected pro"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"mpt. When the pointer leaves, all marks return to their default length while the selected mark stays"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" dark.\n- Assistant, tool, command, steering, and injected-context rows are excluded. A one-prompt co"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"nversation still renders one mark."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Clone or copy this repository into the Harness root `plugins` directory:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Then open a terminal in the `deepseek-harness` root and run:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Windows**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**macOS / Linux**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Keep the `plugins/dsh-prompt-rail` directory after installation.\n## Development"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The development layout expects sibling checkouts:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then run:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`lib/` is committed because profile installation loads the prebuilt Host and browser files without r"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"unning package build scripts."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Release checklist"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Add an exact compatibility patch for every supported pre-slot Harness revision.\n2. Run `pnpm run "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"check` and exercise `node compat/install.mjs --apply-only` in a clean matching checkout.\n3. Commit s"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ource, `lib/`, `compat/`, README files, screenshot, and lockfile.\n4. Push a `v0.1.0` tag and create "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"a GitHub Release from that tag.\n5. State the compatible Harness versions and revision hashes in the "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"se from that tag.\n5. State the compatible Harness versions and revision hashes in the release notes."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
